1. Shared MCP server (hosts all the agents’ tools, port 9900 — required now)

cd agents/MCP
py -3 main.py
2. Orchestrator Agent (the real LLM-driven process the UI’s L1/L2/L3 buttons hit, port 9021 — required now)

cd agents/orchestrator
py -3 server.py
3. Main app (port 9000 — serves classify/approve/reject/resolve, and is what the UI’s /api proxy targets)

uvicorn app.main:app --port 9000
4. osTicket (yours, unchanged)

php -S 127.0.0.1:8081 -t ~/osticket
5. UI

cd ui
npm ci
npm run build
npm run dev
